__label\">Zisk, USD</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"case__meta\">\n<div class=\"case__meta-row\"><span class=\"case__meta-key\">Region</span><span class=\"case__meta-val\">Asie a Pacifik</span></div>\n<div class=\"case__meta-row\"><span class=\"case__meta-key\">Období</span><span class=\"case__meta-val num\">2026</span></div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"case__cta\">Číst případovku<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" height=\"12\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\" width=\"12\"><path d=\"M3 9L9 3M9 3H4M9 3v5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path></svg></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"card case\" data-reveal=\"\" href=\"/cs/results/chicken-train-cote-divoire/\">\n<div class=\"case__top\"><span class=\"case__code\">CHICKEN TRAIN</span><span class=\"case__tag\">iGaming</span></div>\n<h3 class=\"case__title\">Chicken Train: koncept, ze kterého vznikla hra</h3>\n<p class=\"case__summary\">Rychlá hra na Pobřeží slonoviny, vyškálovaná na Meta při instalaci za 0,80 dolaru, na kreativním nápadu, který přežil samotnou kampaň.</p>\n<div class=\"metrics\">\n<div class=\"metric\" data-tone=\"pos\">\n<span class=\"metric__figure\"><span class=\"metric__value\">65<em class=\"metric__unit\">%</em></span></span>\n<span class=\"metric__label\">Návratnost</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"metric\" data-tone=\"pos\">\n<span class=\"metric__figure\"><span class=\"metric__value\">554,2<em class=\"metric__unit\">k</em></span></span>\n<span class=\"metric__label\">Výnos, $</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"metric\" data-tone=\"pos\">\n<span class=\"metric__figure\"><span class=\"metric__value\">0,80<em class=\"metric__unit\"> USD</em></span></span>\n<span class=\"metric__label\">Náklad na instalaci</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"metric\" data-tone=\"pos\">\n<span class=\"metric__figure\"><span class=\"metric__value\">40-45<em class=\"metric__unit\">%</em></span></span>\n<span class=\"metric__label\">Registrace na vklad</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class